---
version: 2
id: workspace
requires: [workspace]
---
@if nonempty(workspace.roots)
## Workspace
@if workspace.pathMode == "VIRTUAL"
Native file tools can address only the mounted workspace roots below. Use an absolute workspace path beginning with a listed root name.
@else
Use an absolute path for every file-tool path argument. The roots below are the working context; the Boundaries section states whether other paths are reachable.
@endif
- Roots:
@for root in workspace.roots
@if workspace.pathMode == "VIRTUAL"
  - `{{root.mountedPath}}`
@else
  - `{{root.hostPath}}`
@endif
@if root.operational
    (operational root)
@endif
@endfor
@endif
